     * pays for exactly one generation. Finish (consume) the store transaction only when the view
     * reports `PaymentSettled: true`; after a failed generation keep it and retry with the same
     * receipt and a NEW `relatedEntityID` — the retry is free for the player.
     */
    payment?: PaymentProof;
    /**
